Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:36:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Update the yanked spin dependency to its compatible patch
 release

The registry yanks spin 0.9.8 while both stable upstream and main still select it. Select 0.9.9 with unchanged dependency requirements, features and MSRV, and synchronize the Bazel lock facts.

Focused regression: cargo deny check advisories -D yanked fails on 0.9.8 and passes on 0.9.9. Maintained just bazel-lock-update refreshes only the spin crate facts. Full emitted-patch verification remains required.
